  "batch_and_parallel_conditions": [
    "For independent identical disjoint circuits, A=k*g and delta=d give A*delta/k=g*d.",
    "For reused serial workspace, k evaluations with g gates and d depth have A=k*g and delta=k*d, so A*delta/k=k*g*d before sharing optimizations.",
    "Sharing, coherent lookup, pipeline overlap and retained intermediate states require actual circuit accounting.",
    "CNOT copies of basis encodings preserve coherence and require gates, qubits and a schedule.",
    "Fixed classical prefix precomputation can be amortized. Coherently indexed prefix data needs charged reversible access.",
    "Use all gates and full depth in one library when comparing with a gate-depth budget. T-only or Toffoli-only figures are partial accounting."
  ],
